      "text": "[7:13PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nModerate traffic flow from Custom Checkpoint to Agbara, inward Morogbo, with movement slowed due to ongoing market activities. However, the return journey is proceeding smoothly.\nGood traffic conditions on the route from Ajibade to Odofa, Church Gate, Ibiye, Magbon, and down to Oko Afo.\nOptimal traffic flow from Oko Afo to Elijah Age, Mowo, Aradagun, Ibereko, and through to Badagry Roundabout, connecting Joseph Dosu Way.\nReturn journeys throughout the axis are also moving well, with no reported impediments.\n\nTraffic Officers are actively on ground, working to maintain a smooth and efficient traffic flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
