      "text": "[7:57PM] #OjoduBerger #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth movement in both directions, with some areas experiencing slow and steady traffic flow, including Isheri Olowora, River Valley, and Kosoko.\nSlight delays approaching VIS and Grammar School.\nImproved movement towards Omole Junction and Excellence, despite traffic alternation.\nSlow traffic towards Ogba.\nRoad rehabilitation is currently underway at Caterpillar, resulting in lane blockage.\nSlow movement approaching Odo Eran, with better traffic flow towards Wempco.\nSteady movement from Wempco to Lateef Jakande, connecting Omole Junction.\nBetter traffic conditions towards VIS, Kosoko, and River Valley, although approaching Isheri Olowora remains slow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
